    "softmax_optimize": "The original prev_multiple_of helper, original four-loop kernel and existing index-commuted candidate are pasted verbatim in Kernels.lean. Both Python modules, wrappers and public Correct/FPEquiv/Contract/IO are byte-identical. All explicit casts, dtype queries, NaN/infinity guards, reduction order, loop bounds, masks and stores remain. Pointer types and constexpr/call metadata stay outside the function bodies. Only used runtime N is bound externally; unused M remains declared in the signature. The former fabricated cols register is removed and proofs follow the actual N binding before pid assignment. The actual cdiv expression N+(B-1) is connected to the former proof value under the existing positive tile condition. Candidate remains exactly four integer address commutations; no floating arithmetic rewrite or fabricated cast identity. Complete arbitrary-model pair execution/failure/safety and the full Real/concrete FP row/grid, frame, host and Tensor proofs are replayed. No new axiom, whole-kernel premise, numerical experiment, public domain narrowing or shared frontend change."
